    "compiled_by": "philip + claude · 2026-08-28",
    "basis": "Hand-curated Layer-1 ground-truth for the 200 most common English words in Indonesian tourism/hospitality/everyday context. Every entry is a widely-agreed translation that would appear consistently across Tatoeba EN-ID corpus · KBBI · Google Translate · Wiktionary. Compiled as a starter anchor set until the full Tatoeba EN-ID download (~300k pairs) is integrated.",
    "future_upgrade": "Replace this file OR add a second-tier ground_truth by downloading the Tatoeba EN-ID sentence corpus (CC-BY 2.0) from https://tatoeba.org/en/downloads and materialising into a nex.brain_english_ground_truth table. Until then, this JSON serves as Layer-1 for the vocab pipeline.",
